Package: ubuntu-cloud-sync
Version: 0.4.2
Architecture: all
Maintainer: GNOME Cloud Sync Prototype <prototype@localhost>
Depends: python3, python3-gi, gir1.2-gtk-4.0 (>= 4.10), python3-nautilus, systemd
Recommends: onedrive (>= 2.5.12), rclone, x-terminal-emulator, gnome-control-center, gvfs-backends
Description: GTK setup and GNOME Files badges for cloud sync
 Uses OneDrive Client for Linux and rclone as separate per-user engines.
